codex
The proposal is a localized but consensus-critical split between user gas charging and block gas enforcement. The main scoring uncertainty is not the intent, but the draft’s missing normative detail about how gross gas propagates through block validation and interfaces; I’ll record that once under under-specification rather than inflating several rows.
